## Rule numbers

Rule numbers changed between Issue 8 and Issue 9. The numbers in `references/writing-rules.md`
follow Issue 9, from the TechScribe table. The Section 6 numbers are the least consistent between
public sources. Make sure against the official PDF before you quote a Section 6 number.
